# Changelog - 2026-02-15
# Session Summary: Implemented Tag Expansion Pipeline fixes and unified node structures

================================================================================
1. FIXED EXPANDED MODE NOT SHOWING FULL OPTIONS
================================================================================

Problem:
  - full_body slot only showed 15 options instead of 1,317 in expanded mode
  - 246 dresses were not appearing in the UI

Root Cause:
  - _merge_expanded_catalogs() was not populating index_by_body_part for clothing
  - Clothing slots use index_by_body_part for lookups, so expanded items weren't indexed

Files Modified:
  - C:\Local\Github\Random-character-prompt-for-SD-\generator\prompt_generator.py
  - C:\Local\Comfy UI\custom_nodes\auto_prompt\prompt_generator.py

Code Added (lines 287-305):
  # Merge index_by_body_part for clothing catalog
  if name == "clothing":
      if "index_by_body_part" not in self.catalogs[name]:
          self.catalogs[name]["index_by_body_part"] = {}
      for item in new_items:
          item_id = item.get("id")
          group = item.get("group")
          if item_id and group:
              if group not in self.catalogs[name]["index_by_body_part"]:
                  self.catalogs[name]["index_by_body_part"][group] = []
              if item_id not in self.catalogs[name]["index_by_body_part"][group]:
                  self.catalogs[name]["index_by_body_part"][group].append(item_id)

Result:
  - Lightweight mode: 15 full_body options
  - Expanded mode: 1,317 full_body options (including 246 dresses)

